{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/Harvest_Asteroids_Title.png?t=1750412063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/Asteroids.gif?t=1750412063\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Target individual asteroids, scan for hidden deposits, and extract raw materials with precise clicks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every rock formation is unique. Some teem with rare metals, others hide crystalline minerals. So choose wisely to build the foundation of your galactic empire.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/Discover_Advanced_Technologies_Title.png?t=1750412063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/Drones.gif?t=1750412063\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through a deep tech tree to unlock power stations, drone squadrons, and self-drilling turret arrays, each breakthrough multiplying your output and strategic options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deploy fleets of drilling and data-gathering satellites that autonomously harvest asteroids at light-speed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/Construct_Space_Stations_Title.png?t=1750412063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/Station.gif?t=1750412063\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct modular orbital hub stations where production lines, transport conduits, and docking ships operate in seamless harmony.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optimize power distribution, logistics routes, and defense systems (shields, lasers, and missile batteries) to ensure your station thrives even in the harshest environments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/Assemble_Interstellar_Industry_Title.png?t=1750412063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/Factory.gif?t=1750412063\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Refine raw ores into high-grade components, assemble everything from mining lasers to defense satellites, and pack finished goods for intergalactic trade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automate assembly lines, synchronize production schedules, and exploit every market. Each crafted item pushing your industrial might ever further.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819620?t=1750412063","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819620?t=1750412063","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/8d7bdce1fe71a64b1561539066f3aad2320e9308/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750412063","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/8d7bdce1fe71a64b1561539066f3aad2320e9308/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750412063","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p clas